{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_9_level_main_09-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_9",
  "stageId": "main_09-01",
  "title": "鬼魂危機",
  "storyCode": "9-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "28b51d64460a552e6eeb93e618de0cd9ade9f310270d3857936e8d5d43d6c189",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小丘郡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中型移動城市，距離倫蒂尼姆不遠不近，以農業與輕工業為支柱產業，與周圍各郡的聯繫並不緊密——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和情報裡描繪的完全一致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Outcast，你是不是到了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛到一分鐘。你是在我身上裝了追蹤器嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一晚上呼叫了你十幾次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在荒地趕路，信號自然不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，行吧。先說好，不是我著急，這都是Misery在催我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他的性格你清楚，總是擔心這擔心那的。要我說，他不放心我就算了，連你出任務都這麼操心，他怎麼還沒有多長幾條皺紋啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——倘若他不是這樣的人，他就不叫Misery了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有道理。正經地說，你覺得這座城市怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "非常普通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那情報會不會出錯了啊，像這種規模的城市，在維多利亞起碼有三四十座——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倫蒂尼姆的太陽再怎麼耀眼，都總有照不到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也看過資料，應該知道，小丘郡的管轄權目前並不在任何一位大貴族手上。有兩位伯爵對這座移動城市表示過興趣，卻均未付諸行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，因為這地方沒什麼油水可賺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，或許正是因為它的普通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而越是貌似普通的角落，就越容易潛藏暗流。無論羅德島決定何時動身，這都是個一探前路的好機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，需要我接應的話，隨時說。我剛準備動身去康納郡，現在離你還很近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安置感染者的工作可不輕鬆。比起你們的工作，我只是來跑跑腿而已，說不定大半時間都在辦事處裡喝茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你別騙我，風暴當前，像你這樣的薩科塔會甘於喝茶？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我也想好好地過退休生活啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我怎麼就不信呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算啦，還是各自幹完活，早點回家吧。Outcast，我記得還有好幾個薩科塔的新幹員等著你上射擊課？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，他們偶爾也需要一些自習時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有，雖然我知道沒什麼必要，但這是Misery逼我說的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請小心，Outcast，但願前路沒有危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有......危險嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，這樣的地方，恐怕不太適合我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6:50 A.M. 天氣/陰\n維多利亞小丘郡駐軍營地審訊室，走廊"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長，這地方好悶啊，一點都不透氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去年在倉庫城訊問連環爆炸案嫌疑人的時候，你也這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再來多少次也不習慣啊。隊長，你還不如叫大提琴一起來。她那兩米高的個頭，至少能把對面嚇得老實一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "換你當著嫌疑人的面把鐵製的桌子一拳砸穿也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊哈，哈哈......我一時沒控制住。那傢伙挾持了兩個小孩，還對死者家屬陰陽怪氣，隊長你當時不也很生氣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你把他脖子上的禁錮裝置捏出了手指印。那傢伙當場嚇得尿了褲子，哆哆嗦嗦地把同夥名字和炸彈座標全交代了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這大部分是隊長的功勞吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是必要的審訊手段罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，這些什麼手段啦我都不太行，我的訊問學基礎理論課是勉強才考過的，平時作業也都是抄我好朋友的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那正好，反正今天我們的首要任務是在一旁聽著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對哦！不過隊長，時間不是馬上就要到了嗎？為什麼沒人過來帶我們進去？那個上尉不是通知我們審訊是從七點開始嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......還有四分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問凱利上尉在嗎？我們和他約好在這裡見面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是否在七點有一場審訊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "昨天下午有一名當地男性因涉嫌走私非法源石製品被捕。你是否知道他被關押在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這位朋友一問三不知欸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想，小丘郡的時間或許和倫蒂尼姆的時間有所不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，有這回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少對這位凱利上尉來說是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來我們只好入鄉隨俗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經過去十分鐘了欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "頻繁看時間也不會使我們的同僚來得更快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛好，我得和你談談昨天那場並未真正發生的戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？隊長......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你別想就這麼糊弄過去。我問你，當我下令回撤的時候，你為什麼要撲向那個貨箱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長，你當時喊的不是其他人回撤嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在進入倉庫之前，你對我下的命令是一定要活捉嫌疑人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是最初的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，命令就是命令吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長，當時我們都以為嫌疑人引爆了炸彈，對不對？我的判斷是只有我有機會完成這項任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我能擋住衝擊波，就能保住嫌疑人的命，同時你們也更安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，我不是質疑隊長你的盾啦......上次你在薩爾貢雇傭兵的高爆炮彈轟炸下救了我，我可不會忘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我想說的不是這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果，我是說如果，那貨箱裡裝的真是炸彈，你可能會受重傷，甚至丟掉性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？不會的吧。遭竊的那批源石製品裡沒有很高規格的爆破品，就算有人私自改造，威力也不會超過我們實戰演習時用的破城彈呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿，我的身體還扛得住啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "作戰時候不要過度依賴瓦伊凡的身體素質。這句話我對你說過多少次了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......五次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我覺得起碼有十次。我相信斯利姆老師一定也教過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "教過......的吧？哈，哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的笑臉對我不起作用。我是你的隊長。我要對手底下每個人的安危負責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對不起，隊長......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等回去以後，你知道怎麼做吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "叫我跑圈沒問題......可是隊長，我還是好想吃晚飯啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有時候，我也不知道該拿你怎麼辦。風笛，你是我手下最出色的戰士。除了優秀的作戰能力，你對遵循命令的執拗也......總能超出預期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那必須呀！小時候媽媽就說過，“瓦伊凡的女人一定要堅持到底”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算頂著狂風大雨也沒啥，要是不能在麥子全被淋濕前把它們都收好，寶貴的糧食可是會發黴的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我並不是在誇你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了。就算我再怎麼擺臭臉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也很難改變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "相信我，隊長，你的臉完全不夠凶......那種瞪著明亮的雙眼陰森森地用最惡劣的維多利亞粗口放狠話的人我見慣了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，這種沒有意義的好話不會對一名合格的維多利亞軍人產生作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......您的意思是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這......非這樣不可嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "達米安他......不，我是說巴里，他從小是個老實孩子，我向您保證，他頂多就是誤入歧途......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉。是的，我會遵守命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是，那些倫蒂尼姆來的人還在這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白了。我會吩咐下去的，長官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請您放心。我時刻記得，我首先是一名......維多利亞士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，隊長，你又在看時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不像你，能不分場合地發呆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長，老實說，我在想那個倉庫裡的菲林。我還蠻喜歡他唱的歌的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道為什麼，我想像了一下，這首歌很適合邊開曳引機邊唱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“冬眠的山馱著成群的牧獸~”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他在瞪我耶。是我唱得走調了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你記錯歌詞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噢！不是牧獸嗎？那是房子？還是翻土機？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那邊站著的小丘郡的朋友，你知道這首歌的歌詞應該是什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你不該在這裡唱歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，這違反你們的規定了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少，不要在我們面前唱那群人唱的歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那群人？哪群人？我不懂你在說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在羞辱我嗎，瓦伊凡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？你為什麼要生氣呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......風笛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總覺得哪裡奇奇怪怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在不是閒聊的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，我不是在說這個......隊長，我好像聽見裡面也有人在唱歌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陰暗的走廊深處傳來了同樣的調子，更低沉、更粗糙，時不時被幾聲猛烈的咳嗽打斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人是不是就在裡面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，你們不能進去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿！你——你是昨天在郊外倉庫裡被抓的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虛弱的青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳......哈......你說達米安嗎？可憐的達米安......他早就被帶走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？！什麼時候啊？我們怎麼不知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他被帶去了哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虛弱的青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪裡......哈哈哈......你們問去了哪裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虛弱的青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他已經......已經......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "閉嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是說你也想和他一個下場？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在威脅他。你為什麼要威脅他？昨天來的那個人到底去了哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虛弱的青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......哈......他回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回......家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他被釋放啦？難道他真的和鬼魂部隊沒有關係？隊長——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......讓我進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "未經允許，你們不能和犯人交談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要見凱利上尉。讓開，士兵。我知道他就在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他不在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你？你是倉庫裡那個罵人的副官，我記得你。你想說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上尉有急事離開了，他讓我來轉告你們一聲——審訊在一個小時以前就結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......！你的意思是，你們把錯誤的時間告訴了我們？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "溝通失誤。在哪裡都不算罕見，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說什麼溝通失誤啦......當我們是傻子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長，他們玩傳假消息這招，把我們套進去了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這不是關鍵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我問你，士兵，為什麼現在你出面告訴我們這訊息？既然已經耽擱這麼久，你們一定不介意讓我們浪費更多時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "關於您的這項疑問......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲彙報）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯卡曼德羅斯中尉，我接到的命令是把以下消息告知您——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "犯人達米安·巴里，也就是您十分關心的那位——已在十分鐘前，因在押送途中試圖搶奪武器、襲擊士兵而被擊斃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......你在胡說什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們見過那個青年，他就是個普通人呀，他見到我們的時候嚇得都不怎麼敢動，怎麼可能主動攻擊全副武裝的軍人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也就是說，你們未經審判，直接處決了嫌疑人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已經向您傳達了事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長，我們被陰了。他們為什麼不讓我們和嫌疑人接觸？我們不是站在同一邊的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在還不清楚他們的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唯一能確定的是，想要繼續追查，只能靠我們自己了。駐軍的態度已經明朗，他們不會為我們提供任何幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我也不傻，我能看出來的，他們不耍小手段就不錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下面我們怎麼辦啊？好不容易追到的線索又斷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得想想別的辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對哦！我剛想起來，那個叫達米安的青年，他說他的工作是分揀馬鈴薯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "每個移動城市周邊的農用地塊，都會有專門的往城裡運送農作物的管道哎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "順藤摸瓜的話，應該能找到務農人員的聚落，要是能和他的朋友或者親屬聊聊，線索說不定能接上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......很像你的思路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那打探消息的事情就交給我吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很好，立刻行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長，你要跟我一起去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我留下來和駐軍交涉。我想，他們不會不經審訊就把人草草處決。只要有過審訊，就會有記錄留下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三角鐵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角鐵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長，我們在城郊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們遇襲了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角鐵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們突然冒了出來，我被發現了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角鐵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這群人的作戰手法和使用的武器都完全吻合之前的情報......小鼓的源石技藝都很難打中他們！該死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "記住，你的首要任務是活著回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角鐵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瞭解，隊長！問題不大！三角鐵通訊完畢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是重要情報。我們的目標，那支傳說中鬼魂一樣的部隊，此刻就在小丘郡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
